description.narrative:
The overall objective of the project is to enhance radioactive waste management capabilities in 
Moldova including for retrieval of legacy radioactive waste and identification of final disposal 
solutions in accordance with the National Action Plan for 2017-2026 (under the National 
Strategy for radioactive waste management).

To achieve the overall objective, the following specific objectives will be the focus of the 
project:

• Updated legal and regulatory framework in line with EU and international standards;
• Human resource plan for operator and regulator in place;
• Interim storage facility prepared for operation;
• Radiological and environmental monitoring programme installed;
• Support in decommissioning of the legacy RADON-type disposal facility;
• Disposal program for radioactive waste developed; and
• Open and transparent public engagement processes in place and application of 
environmental impact assessment.
